          "media": {
            "duration": 973,
            "fileSize": 15715321
          },
          "description": "This cozy winter collection features short, gentle stories for ages 3–6 about two best friends: thoughtful, careful Beaver and playful, spontaneous Otter. Together, they experience snowy days, rainy afternoons, sick days, and quiet winter nights. Through familiar moments like sharing cocoa, building in the snow, and fixing mistakes, children hear comforting stories about friendship, patience, and learning to work together even when friends are different.",
